  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1729825114_3838925_f783f33beb6dbcf7c2fc8ece615ccdfc.png",
  "description": "<div data-block-id=\"block-56d4ec26-55b5-409b-a909-5be76a330609\"><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong></div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-25cd2771-8244-40d3-b8aa-82662452ba8a\">LunaSol is a wedding dance shoe brand dedicated to helping brides look beautiful, dance gracefully, and stay comfortable throughout their wedding day and night. Handcrafted in Portugal, LunaSol shoes blend the elegance of bridal fashion with the functionality and comfort of dance shoes.</div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-b0b1b978-ea9d-4245-9d83-3e928eef3ff2\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-6eba1880-f610-4308-97fd-7517fcee3e96\">LunaSol shoes are designed specifically for brides and special occasions, combining premium materials like buttery soft goatskin leather with a range of supportive features for all-day wear. With styles including a \"something blue\" ballroom shoe and delicate lace tango shoes, LunaSol offers brides a unique alternative to traditional wedding heels&mdash;one that seamlessly transitions from ceremony to dance floor.</div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-9b8c00b5-18d2-49dd-adc8-6d7b5a7df2e0\"><strong>Unique Selling Point (USP):</strong></div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-7d469081-1fb3-47cf-8022-bffb92396e12\">LunaSol shoes are the perfect fusion of style and comfort, crafted specifically for dancing and special moments. Brides no longer have to sacrifice elegance for comfort or change shoes mid-celebration. With LunaSol, they can look and feel their best from the first step down the aisle to the last dance of the night.</div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-0d807fa8-11d0-48f8-9c6d-1f8eace6de42\"><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-213161c4-1fc5-44f7-a41e-710a6d36955c\">Affiliates earn 7% commission per sale, equating to approximately $25 on a $350 pair of shoes. Payouts are made monthly through our affiliate platform.</div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-c5db5334-bde5-48f5-b895-ad16a7be44ee\"><strong>Other Information:</strong></div>\r\n<div data-block-id=\"block-fb9dca9a-05cf-4a9a-8351-11b01e8b56e5\">Our ambassadors and affiliates receive exclusive discount codes and tracking links to share with their audience, making it easy to earn commissions. LunaSol shoes are ideal for influencers in the bridal, dance, and fashion niches, especially those who prioritize elegance and comfort. We&rsquo;re looking for passionate affiliates who want to share a high-quality product with their audience, making brides&rsquo; wedding days even more special.</div>",
